WEBVTT

00:02.470 --> 00:05.990
The Dragon Water Priestess
has been waiting for you here.

00:24.090 --> 00:25.590
Please excuse me.

00:26.670 --> 00:28.800
Welcome.

00:31.710 --> 00:35.349
I had been waiting for you.

00:35.350 --> 00:36.379
Huh?

00:36.380 --> 00:39.350
My apologies. I should adjust
my appearance to match yours.

00:45.150 --> 00:47.110
I am the Dragon Water Priestess...

00:48.220 --> 00:50.070
...my name is Shildina.

00:51.610 --> 00:55.260
I am Raphtalia, here as a representative.

00:57.460 --> 00:59.930
The reason I invited you here
is none other than this...

01:00.650 --> 01:02.500
I ask that you immediately call off...

01:03.150 --> 01:05.270
...the rebel army's attack
on the Old Capital.

01:13.340 --> 01:17.060
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

02:37.220 --> 02:40.129
EPISODE 10: A PRAY

02:40.130 --> 02:41.349
EPISODE 10: A PRAY
I'll go.

02:41.350 --> 02:42.600
Please wait!

02:43.060 --> 02:46.099
The letter clearly says
that you must go alone!

02:46.100 --> 02:49.099
In that case, we won't be able
to protect you, Lady Raphtalia!

02:49.100 --> 02:50.779
I'm against it too.

02:50.780 --> 02:54.049
I already said this, but if it's for
the sake of the Heavenly Emperor,

02:54.050 --> 02:57.080
the Water Dragon Priestess
will use any dirty tricks she can.

02:57.530 --> 02:59.670
Dirty tricks, huh...

03:00.830 --> 03:03.220
Master Naofumi, what do you think?

03:03.860 --> 03:05.370
It's true this is too risky,

03:05.830 --> 03:09.250
but this is also a chance to meet
the Water Dragon Priestess directly.

03:09.730 --> 03:12.089
If I am to become the Heavenly Emperor,

03:12.090 --> 03:15.409
I'll have to speak with
the Water Dragon Priestess eventually.

03:15.410 --> 03:17.370
Wouldn't it be worth
answering the summons?

03:20.490 --> 03:21.820
Very well.

03:24.390 --> 03:27.989
I want to explore over there too!

03:27.990 --> 03:30.649
I taught her a bunch of things on the fly,

03:30.650 --> 03:33.529
but I'm sure Raphtalia
will handle it just fine.

03:33.530 --> 03:37.020
Well, if anything happens,
Raph-chan will let us know.

03:39.550 --> 03:42.910
Raphtalia has been entrusted with
full authority over the negotiations.

03:44.770 --> 03:46.920
This kind of experience
will be necessary for her.

03:48.440 --> 03:51.040
Calling off the attack on the Old Capital?

03:51.410 --> 03:54.569
The rebel army I had once
dismissed as a mere rabble

03:54.570 --> 03:58.800
is now becoming a force
we cannot ignore.

03:59.380 --> 04:04.269
As long as you continue the conflict,
we will have no choice but to fight back.

04:04.270 --> 04:08.020
Depending on how things unfold,
the Old Capital could turn into a sea of flames,

04:08.470 --> 04:10.730
and many lives would be lost.

04:12.390 --> 04:16.490
But surely, that is not your true intention.

04:17.330 --> 04:19.740
With that in mind,
I have a proposal.

04:20.110 --> 04:20.990
A proposal?

04:21.870 --> 04:25.450
Cease your rebellion and surrender to us.

04:25.790 --> 04:29.920
If you do so, we shall overlook both
your crimes and those of the rebel army.

04:30.910 --> 04:33.880
You are, after all,
a relative of the Heavenly Emperor.

04:34.210 --> 04:36.909
Once the rebel army is
incorporated into our forces,

04:36.910 --> 04:41.140
we will welcome you into the government
as a high official to oversee them.

04:41.600 --> 04:46.220
If you wish, you may even return
to your territory in Melromarc.

04:46.590 --> 04:49.440
We guarantee your safety
and that of your village.

04:50.770 --> 04:53.900
Surely this is not a bad offer for you.

04:55.660 --> 04:56.610
True enough...

04:57.370 --> 05:00.049
I came to this country to declare
that I had no intention...

05:00.050 --> 05:04.580
...of becoming the Heavenly Emperor
and to clear up that misunderstanding.

05:05.370 --> 05:06.290
But...

05:06.700 --> 05:10.250
What I have seen here are
countless people who suffer.

05:10.670 --> 05:14.670
People who are unable to defend themselves
against monsters due to the mandate.

05:15.070 --> 05:19.600
And officials who exploit them,
imposing heavy taxes and cruelty.

05:21.310 --> 05:23.589
I also heard that the Orochi rampage
the other day

05:23.590 --> 05:26.470
was caused by
the Heavenly Emperor's blessing.

05:27.870 --> 05:32.260
The revolutionaries fight with anger
in their hearts toward the government.

05:32.960 --> 05:36.440
Their suffering has already
reached its limits!

05:41.590 --> 05:44.700
Seeing them, I realized something.

05:45.450 --> 05:47.110
I want to save the suffering people...

05:47.880 --> 05:49.410
...the citizens.

05:50.250 --> 05:53.870
Forgive me, but I must decline your proposal.

05:54.610 --> 05:59.340
Obeying the government would only
bring greater suffering to the people.

06:00.770 --> 06:02.150
I see.

06:02.720 --> 06:06.550
So you truly care for the people.

06:07.760 --> 06:12.430
In that case,
allow me to offer another proposal.

06:14.070 --> 06:17.260
Our forces will withdraw
from the Old Capital.

06:18.430 --> 06:21.490
In return, I ask that the rebels
also lay down their arms...

06:22.330 --> 06:24.950
...and agree to a temporary ceasefire.

06:26.020 --> 06:27.900
You would leave the Old Capital to us?

06:28.360 --> 06:30.020
And a ceasefire?

06:30.600 --> 06:32.660
If you can accept these terms,

06:33.160 --> 06:37.299
I will arrange for you to meet with
His Majesty Ruftmilia, the Heavenly Emperor,

06:37.300 --> 06:39.020
to negotiate peace.

06:39.950 --> 06:41.890
A meeting with the Heavenly Emperor himself?

06:42.890 --> 06:47.640
We do not wish to drag
the people further into war either.

06:49.130 --> 06:52.879
Can I really trust those words?

06:52.880 --> 06:54.850
I... no,

06:55.310 --> 06:57.590
as the Water Dragon Priestess Shildina,

06:58.220 --> 07:01.570
I swear to fulfill this promise!

07:05.230 --> 07:06.340
Understood.

07:07.600 --> 07:12.450
As a representative,
I accept your proposal.

07:15.610 --> 07:16.960
My gratitude.

07:19.970 --> 07:21.559
Once preparations are complete,

07:21.560 --> 07:24.920
I shall send a letter
regarding the next meeting.

07:25.390 --> 07:28.220
Yes, I will be waiting.

07:29.540 --> 07:31.220
Now then, if you'll excuse me.

07:32.370 --> 07:34.250
One last thing...

07:36.690 --> 07:39.230
Should peace negotiations fail,

07:39.860 --> 07:43.390
there is something I must ask of you.

07:48.030 --> 07:50.619
After the meeting with
the Water Dragon Priestess,

07:50.620 --> 07:53.390
the government forces
withdrew from the Old Capital.

07:54.750 --> 07:56.039
And we,

07:56.040 --> 07:58.749
said to support the new Heavenly Emperor,

07:58.750 --> 08:01.320
were welcomed
by the people of the Old Capital.

08:02.330 --> 08:05.719
When the revolutionaries heard the city
had been surrendered without bloodshed,

08:05.720 --> 08:09.180
they were suspicious of the peace
proposed by the Water Dragon Priestess.

08:10.960 --> 08:14.870
But in the end,
Raphtalia's words persuade them.

08:16.540 --> 08:20.010
To think she would suggest peace...

08:21.510 --> 08:24.929
It must have been an act of
the Water Dragon Priestess on her own authority.

08:24.930 --> 08:29.110
That just shows how bad things must be
within the government forces.

08:30.520 --> 08:32.240
One last thing...

08:33.080 --> 08:35.370
Should peace negotiations fail,

08:35.880 --> 08:38.760
there is something I must ask of you.

08:39.520 --> 08:43.960
If the rebel army wins, the defeated
general will not be spared his life.

08:44.600 --> 08:47.630
At that time...

08:49.030 --> 08:53.390
Would you be willing to accept abdication
from His Majesty Ruftmilia?

08:54.660 --> 08:57.220
The situation is clearly against us...

08:57.750 --> 09:01.700
At this rate, it is only a matter of time
before we are defeated by the rebels.

09:02.490 --> 09:05.270
And yet, His Majesty also wishes
for the people's happiness

09:05.880 --> 09:09.110
and desires to end the conflict!

09:10.200 --> 09:12.870
Please, I beg of you!

09:17.250 --> 09:22.250
I don't know how the negotiations with
the Heavenly Emperor will turn out, but...

09:22.720 --> 09:24.600
I will become the Heavenly Emperor.

09:26.310 --> 09:30.260
I'm sorry, Master Naofumi,
for deciding so much on my own.

09:30.760 --> 09:34.629
If it's what you've chosen,
then I'll respect that.

09:34.630 --> 09:36.010
Me too.

09:36.530 --> 09:39.779
Tomorrow, Itsuki and Rishia
will join us in the Old Capital.

09:39.780 --> 09:43.690
Once they do, we'll perform the ceremony
for your succession as Heavenly Emperor.

09:44.740 --> 09:47.229
With the blessing granted by the ritual,

09:47.230 --> 09:50.140
you should be able to wield
the same power as the Heavenly Emperor.

09:50.600 --> 09:51.380
Yes.

09:57.590 --> 09:59.849
So this is the sanctuary.

09:59.850 --> 10:03.139
This must be the Dragon Hourglass.

10:03.140 --> 10:04.350
It's the Hero language.

10:08.670 --> 10:12.679
It seems to be describing methods
of strengthening the weapons.

10:12.680 --> 10:14.709
HOLY SHIELD POWER-UP METHOD, NUMBER TWO
Holy Shield power-up method, number two:

10:14.710 --> 10:16.159
TRUSTING AND BEING TRUSTED
Holy Shield power-up method, number two:

10:16.160 --> 10:17.259
LEADS TO AN INCREASE IN ABILITIES.
Trusting

10:17.260 --> 10:20.520
and being trusted leads to
an increase in abilities.

10:21.320 --> 10:22.559
Now that I think about it,

10:22.560 --> 10:27.110
I did feel like I could bring out more strength
than usual when we fought together.

10:28.190 --> 10:32.609
On the other hand, Motoyasu, Ren,
and Itsuki grew weaker

10:32.610 --> 10:35.170
when they couldn't trust anyone
and became isolated.

10:36.010 --> 10:38.340
Nothing particularly new
is written here, though.

10:38.900 --> 10:39.740
The next one...

10:40.950 --> 10:43.960
Holy Shield power-up method, number three:

10:44.390 --> 10:46.170
Energy Boost?

10:46.580 --> 10:50.420
The heroes have an energy that they draw out
automatically as power from the weapons,

10:50.780 --> 10:53.130
constantly releasing power.

10:53.680 --> 10:58.410
Assigning this energy to skills will allow
more powerful skills to be used.

11:00.680 --> 11:01.680
OBTAINED: ENERGY BOOST

11:03.460 --> 11:05.020
Energy Boost...

11:07.580 --> 11:08.860
This is...

11:10.440 --> 11:13.490
Master Itsuki is also a user
of the Hengen Muso Peerless Style?!

11:14.090 --> 11:17.490
Then does that mean EP is like "Ki"?

11:17.900 --> 11:20.380
Most likely, it's a similar type of energy.

11:21.010 --> 11:25.369
It seems this EP can be used for skills,
magic, and even attacks...

11:25.370 --> 11:29.340
OBTAINED: ENERGY BOOST

11:29.730 --> 11:33.109
But just focusing on it
makes me feel drained.

11:33.110 --> 11:34.650
Sorry to keep you waiting.

11:35.630 --> 11:38.920
The preparations for the Heavenly Emperor
succession ceremony are complete.

11:47.520 --> 11:54.150
O most revered ancient Heavenly Emperor.

11:55.440 --> 12:01.600
O Water Dragon, who guards the vast seas.

12:02.590 --> 12:07.669
May all calamities, sins,
and impurities be cleansed away.

12:07.670 --> 12:10.750
Raphtalia is so wonderful...

12:11.390 --> 12:12.340
Yeah.

12:36.730 --> 12:41.849
With this, Lady Raphtalia has received the power
for the Heavenly Emperor's enthronement!

12:41.850 --> 12:44.470
A new Heavenly Emperor is born!

12:44.990 --> 12:47.159
Long live the new Heavenly Emperor!

12:47.160 --> 12:48.279
Long live!

12:48.280 --> 12:50.739
They're getting ahead of themselves.

12:50.740 --> 12:52.910
It just shows how happy they are.

12:54.130 --> 12:57.869
So, how is it? What does it feel like
to have received the blessing?

12:57.870 --> 13:00.090
I still can't quite feel it.

13:00.730 --> 13:03.800
But it seems the effect is real.

13:04.420 --> 13:06.390
Master Naofumi, give me your hand.

13:12.940 --> 13:13.849
YOU HAVE RECEIVED THE BLESSING OF THE ARBITER

13:13.850 --> 13:16.189
YOU HAVE RECEIVED THE BLESSING OF THE ARBITER
This is the effect of the blessing?

13:16.190 --> 13:17.529
YOU HAVE RECEIVED THE BLESSING OF THE ARBITER
Later, we'll need to bestow the blessing

13:17.530 --> 13:18.419
Later, we'll need to bestow the blessing

13:18.420 --> 13:20.309
on Itsuki and the others as well.

13:20.310 --> 13:21.270
Yeah.

13:21.740 --> 13:25.580
Also, we found a monument
inscribed with Hero Language.

13:25.930 --> 13:28.619
If we bring Ren to the Dragon Hourglass,

13:28.620 --> 13:30.939
we might be able to uncover new information.

13:30.940 --> 13:34.630
In that case, shall we return
to Melromarc once?

13:35.700 --> 13:36.809
Yeah, let's do that.

13:36.810 --> 13:39.099
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

13:39.100 --> 13:41.840
So that's the current situation
in Q'ten Lo, huh...

13:42.360 --> 13:45.690
And how are the preparations
for the Phoenix battle?

13:46.060 --> 13:50.790
Well, we are advancing the construction of
large-scale weapons for the decisive battle.

13:51.950 --> 13:56.110
With fully grown monsters,
transportation should pose no issue.

13:56.700 --> 14:00.820
We're also having easy-to-use
weapons and accessories made.

14:01.180 --> 14:06.979
I've heard from Mother that she's working
together with Siltvelt to form an allied army.

14:06.980 --> 14:07.950
I see.

14:08.460 --> 14:10.799
Since there haven't been
any attacks on the village,

14:10.800 --> 14:14.000
we can afford to allocate
a few more people to Q'ten Lo.

14:14.940 --> 14:16.630
Sorry to keep you waiting, Ren.

14:17.240 --> 14:19.090
Will you come with us to Q'ten Lo?

14:19.620 --> 14:20.710
Understood.

14:21.340 --> 14:23.719
We returned to Q'ten Lo once again,

14:23.720 --> 14:26.820
and I showed the members I brought
along around the various locations.

14:27.890 --> 14:32.030
I entrusted Rat and Wyndia
to investigate Q'ten Lo's ecosystem.

14:33.210 --> 14:37.650
I brought Imiya's uncle and Ren
to see Motoyasu No. 2.

14:47.760 --> 14:51.039
I also took Ren to the stone
monument in the sanctuary,

14:51.040 --> 14:53.580
but in the end there was
no new information.

14:55.080 --> 15:00.140
Still, since he needed to acquire EP,
it wasn't a wasted effort.

15:01.310 --> 15:04.130
If possible, I'd like Motoyasu
to acquire it too...

15:07.090 --> 15:09.890
...but I don't know where he is
or what he's doing now.

15:10.560 --> 15:14.390
Filo~
Fi~ Fi~ Filo~

15:15.190 --> 15:17.900
Look at this work!

15:18.330 --> 15:21.480
Hey! Kuu, Marine, Midori!

15:21.810 --> 15:24.460
I've drawn Filo's face!

15:26.860 --> 15:28.450
Before long,

15:29.110 --> 15:34.269
word of the liberation of the Old Capital spread,
and regional generals

15:34.270 --> 15:36.119
came to join the revolutionaries.

15:36.120 --> 15:41.159
For the sake of Lady Raphtalia,
we are prepared to lay down our very lives.

15:41.160 --> 15:45.260
We shall prove our loyalty by utterly
destroying the government forces!

15:45.720 --> 15:47.180
Wait, please!

15:48.250 --> 15:51.890
Before that, there is something
I must tell you all!

15:52.310 --> 15:57.639
Our purpose is to save the people of Q'ten Lo
who are suffering under the government.

15:57.640 --> 16:01.190
We're not to annihilate our enemies.

16:02.350 --> 16:07.570
I want to change this country
into one where you can all live freely.

16:08.030 --> 16:11.389
But if that requires sacrificing others,

16:11.390 --> 16:13.660
then we are no different from
the current government.

16:14.230 --> 16:16.870
Please, rather than spilling blood needlessly,

16:17.400 --> 16:21.070
won't you search with me for another way?

16:22.280 --> 16:24.299
How foolish!

16:24.300 --> 16:27.260
You were entrusted with
the defense of the Old Capital!

16:27.630 --> 16:30.629
To abandon that is outrageous!

16:30.630 --> 16:33.099
And now you speak of peace
with the rebels!

16:33.100 --> 16:35.849
What are you thinking?!

16:35.850 --> 16:38.439
I beg you! Please reconsider...!

16:38.440 --> 16:41.020
Silence! You worthless failure!

16:42.340 --> 16:45.229
Even without a divine oracle,

16:45.230 --> 16:51.980
the previous priestess carried out her duties
faithfully, without needless meddling!

16:53.170 --> 16:55.590
To keep the people from
being dragged into war...

16:59.140 --> 17:02.210
Is that not so, Shildina?

17:03.710 --> 17:04.839
Yes!

17:04.840 --> 17:07.419
Your Majesty, this one...

17:07.420 --> 17:11.260
With all respect! I have a matter
I must ask of Lady Makina!

17:11.790 --> 17:14.129
What?! How dare you speak so brazenly!

17:14.130 --> 17:15.029
Permission granted.

17:15.030 --> 17:15.640
Huh?

17:17.560 --> 17:18.730
Speak.

17:19.600 --> 17:22.540
The incident at the port,
the rampage of the Orochi...

17:23.530 --> 17:28.239
...is it true that the breaking of its seal
was caused by a blessing?

17:28.240 --> 17:29.309
What?!

17:29.310 --> 17:30.949
The people are starving

17:30.950 --> 17:33.950
and unable even to defend
themselves from monsters.

17:34.750 --> 17:39.249
I would never claim there are flaws
in your rule, Lady Makina!

17:39.250 --> 17:42.369
However, for the sake of
the people, I believe—

17:42.370 --> 17:44.050
You fool!

17:45.680 --> 17:50.119
I cannot bear to hear such nonsense
before His Majesty any longer!

17:50.120 --> 17:55.300
You have defied His Majesty's orders,
making you no different from a traitor!

17:56.660 --> 18:01.270
Regarding defying the command,
I have no excuse...

18:05.480 --> 18:07.740
Ordinarily, this warrants the death penalty.

18:08.940 --> 18:15.280
But as the Water Dragon Priestess,
your past achievement cannot be ignored.

18:19.610 --> 18:23.319
Thus, with the greatest of mercy,

18:23.320 --> 18:28.800
the judgment must come
from His Majesty himself!

18:30.110 --> 18:32.880
Now, give her your judgment!

18:38.810 --> 18:41.080
I order you, Water Dragon Priestess...

18:41.850 --> 18:43.770
Stake your life and soul...

18:44.500 --> 18:47.990
...to stop the rebel army's
invasion of the capital.

18:50.360 --> 18:52.440
As you command.

19:06.180 --> 19:08.860
Maybe it's about time.

19:10.870 --> 19:12.629
Wait!

19:12.630 --> 19:16.430
It's been three days since the Water Dragon
Priestess returned to the capital.

19:16.960 --> 19:19.659
There hasn't been any word from her so far.

19:19.660 --> 19:23.639
But don't you think the government
forces have slowed down a bit?

19:23.640 --> 19:24.770
Yeah.

19:25.400 --> 19:28.020
There have only been some
small skirmishes here and there,

19:28.380 --> 19:31.600
but we've got Fohl, Atla,
Itsuki, and Ren with us.

19:31.980 --> 19:35.989
And thanks to Raphtalia's blessing,
the enemy's barriers can be nullified.

19:35.990 --> 19:38.660
With our current strength,
there's no real problem.

19:39.090 --> 19:42.779
I wonder if the audience with
the Heavenly Emperor goes well...

19:42.780 --> 19:44.000
Don't worry!

19:45.200 --> 19:49.170
I'm sure Raphtalia's feelings
will reach His Majesty.

19:50.520 --> 19:52.550
Forgive the interruption!

19:53.800 --> 19:56.550
Everyone, please gather
at the castle at once!

19:57.100 --> 19:58.800
Is there an answer from the priestess?

20:03.830 --> 20:06.640
Please, I beg of you!

20:09.240 --> 20:13.740
I understand. At that time,
I shall become the Heavenly Emperor!

20:15.560 --> 20:18.660
Silence! You worthless failure!

20:20.160 --> 20:27.960
The previous priestess carried out her
duties faithfully, without needless meddling!

20:34.250 --> 20:37.630
A report has come in from
our spies inside the capital!

20:38.220 --> 20:41.010
The government army is
assembling in the capital!

20:42.220 --> 20:45.720
Already dozens of units
are forming in ranks!

20:46.160 --> 20:48.230
They're preparing to go on the offensive!

20:48.560 --> 20:49.849
What's going on?!

20:49.850 --> 20:53.280
Wasn't the Water Dragon Priestess
supposed to stop the fighting?!

20:53.740 --> 20:58.939
Were they surrendering the old capital just to
let our guard down and gather their forces?!

20:58.940 --> 21:01.110
Such underhanded tactics...!

21:02.220 --> 21:06.279
Damn it! We must strike first and destroy
the capital before they're fully prepared!

21:06.280 --> 21:07.579
Wait just a moment!

21:07.580 --> 21:08.910
Everyone, calm down!

21:09.810 --> 21:14.169
Even if she is the Water Dragon Priestess,
she has no command over the entire army.

21:14.170 --> 21:15.880
Surely behind this is...

21:16.180 --> 21:19.510
The Heavenly Emperor... no, Makina?!

21:19.970 --> 21:24.409
Have you forgotten what Lady Raphtalia
promised to the Water Dragon Priestess?!

21:24.410 --> 21:27.069
But this is as good as a betrayal!

21:27.070 --> 21:28.520
Yeah! That's right!

21:29.020 --> 21:31.330
We'll march out as well!

21:33.580 --> 21:36.139
This is bad... If things continue like this...

21:36.140 --> 21:37.720
Excuse me!

21:38.600 --> 21:40.779
I bring urgent news!

21:40.780 --> 21:42.309
Now what?!

21:42.310 --> 21:47.049
The Water Dragon Priestess has appeared alone
in front of the Old Capital checkpoint!

21:47.050 --> 21:48.290
Huh?

23:36.230 --> 23:40.940
#11 THE ORACLE PRIESTESS
